  <item>
    <title>张岱「上」：我忆繁华旧梦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691402266018cc2c986dc938</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691402266018cc2c986dc938</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Nov 2025 03:44:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“少为纨绔子弟，极爱繁华，好精舍，好美婢，好娈童，好鲜衣，好美食，好骏马，好华灯，好烟火，好梨园，好鼓吹，好古董，好花鸟，兼以茶淫橘虐，书蠹诗魔，劳碌半生，皆成梦幻。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>张岱出身望族、无忧无虑</span></p><span></span><p><span>品味美食、携友出游、斗鸡走狗、品茗宴饮…</span></p><span></span><p><span>于元宵观灯、端午观船、中秋赏月…</span></p><span></span><p><span>少年鲜衣怒马</span></p><span></span><p><span>在衣袂翻飞间</span></p><span></span><p><span>尽是江南的富庶与雅致</span></p><span></span><p><span>更是未经世事的明媚</span></p><span></span><p><span>然而</span></p><span></span><p><span>这所有的生活气息</span></p><span></span><p><span>成为明亡后</span></p><span></span><p><span>他反复回望的、再也无法触及的旧梦</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：陆小凤传奇配乐、广陵散-吴文光</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：宗其香《漓江夜景》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/62a9523957bdd570f6557ac2/lgTDgdi4XbunfQ6PLyLMlSrVctUo.m4a" length="79097879" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:32</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkMCfQf2RTj1bbL2SLDu4sSE6wmA.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>郦道元：为华夏山河立传</title>
