  <item>
    <title>袁枚：在世俗中做个“生活家”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68bff8b6a56ca3e0c48d01c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68bff8b6a56ca3e0c48d01c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 Sep 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>袁枚是一位复杂的木林人物。</span></p><span></span><p><span>他虽以闲适自居，但生活方式却带有明显的享乐色彩。他虽能自然坦荡地说出自己的热爱，但这也更加印证了其欲望的强烈。他的性灵说虽使诗歌获得鲜活的生命力，但也因过度重情感而轻格局受到后世质疑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>总之，所谓生活，如人饮水，冷暖自知即是也。</span></p><span></span><p><span>仕途起点，厌逢迎 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>辞官归去，享生活 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>生而有性，性灵说 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">27:35</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>志怪故事，子不语 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2219">36:59</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：尤诏汪恭《随园女弟子图》</span></p>]]></description>
